    "---\n",
    "## 3b. WeldNet (FF Autoencoder)\n",
    "\n",
    "WeldNet with feedforward autoencoder compression. Same architecture as PCA variant but learns nonlinear encoding.\n",
    "- Latent dimension: 4\n",
    "- Encoder/Decoder: FFNet (500-500-500)\n",
    "- Dynamics network: FFNet per window"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load config and create model\n",
    "weld_ff_config = load_config(\"../configs/experiments/weldff/weldnormal.yaml\")\n",
    "weld_ff_helper = WeldHelper(weld_ff_config)\n",
    "\n",
    "weld_ff = weld_ff_helper.create_weld(\n",
    "    dataset,\n",
    "    k=4,\n",
    "    seed=SEED,\n",
    "    device=DEVICE,\n",
    "    windows=2\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Windows: {weld_ff.W}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Latent dim: {weld_ff.k}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Train autoencoders (FF needs gradient-based training)\n",
    "print(f\"Training WeldNet FF autoencoders for {EPOCHS_DEMO} epochs...\")\n",
    "_ = weld_ff.train_aes(epochs_first=EPOCHS_DEMO, lr=LR, batch=BATCH_SIZE, printinterval=10)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Train propagators\n",
    "print(f\"Training WeldNet FF propagators for {EPOCHS_DEMO} epochs...\")\n",
    "_ = weld_ff.train_propagators(\n",
    "    epochs=EPOCHS_DEMO,\n",
    "    lr=LR,\n",
    "    batch=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
    "    printinterval=10,\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 4. LDNet (Grid-based Latent Dynamics)\n",
    "\n",
    "LDNet learns dynamics in latent space with grid-based time stepping:\n",
    "- Dynamics network: (params, z) → dz/dt\n",
    "- Reconstruction network: (params, z) → u(x)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
