    "---\n",
    "## 7. LDON (Latent DeepONet)\n",
    "\n",
    "Latent Deep Operator Network combining autoencoder with DeepONet:\n",
    "- Autoencoder compresses initial condition to latent space\n",
    "- Branch network maps latent code to basis coefficients\n",
    "- Trunk network maps time to basis functions\n",
    "- DeepONet reconstructs latent trajectory via Einstein summation"
   ]
  },
